{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fractured Rift is a <i><strong>turn-based</strong>, <strong>grid-based rogue lite</strong></i> where strategy and customization are key. When a mysterious rift to another world tears open, you gather a team of skilled warriors or mages and set out to explore its shifting depths.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Choose your team</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equip them with powerful gear, and enter the rift, an endless descent through <i><strong>procedurally generated floors</strong></i> filled with dangerous enemies, new biomes, and evolving challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along the way, <i><strong>recruit new units, unlock new skills</strong></i>, and shape each unit with unique talents and equipment to fit your tactical vision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581670/extras/87775c293f1e100147c0d3c6cae0b072.poster.avif?t=1756916723\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581670/extras/87775c293f1e100147c0d3c6cae0b072.webm?t=1756916723\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581670/extras/87775c293f1e100147c0d3c6cae0b072.mp4?t=1756916723\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Play at your own pace</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Command each move <i><strong>manually</strong></i> for full control, or let the game handle actions in <i><strong>auto</strong></i> battle mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581670/extras/5a34da156c9b8d241aaf7c0509af3959.poster.avif?t=1756916723\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581670/extras/5a34da156c9b8d241aaf7c0509af3959.webm?t=1756916723\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581670/extras/5a34da156c9b8d241aaf7c0509af3959.mp4?t=1756916723\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Reward</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After each floor, you\u2019ll earn <strong>shards</strong>, a currency used to purchase powerful rewards in the shop, like stat-enhancing potions, crafting materials,\u00a0 buffs, or rare skill scrolls. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581670/extras/ef4ee708ba4f8da491b2ad033a3a8992.poster.avif?t=1756916723\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581670/extras/ef4ee708ba4f8da491b2ad033a3a8992.webm?t=1756916723\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581670/extras/ef4ee708ba4f8da491b2ad033a3a8992.mp4?t=1756916723\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Use It or Keep It</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But there\u2019s a twist: if your team is defeated, you can redeem unused items<strong> from your inventory</strong> to be used in future explorations. So you have to decide whether to\u00a0<strong><i>use your resources now or save them for future explorations?</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you prefer full control or a more automated approach, the game lets you manually command your team or let them act on their own in auto battle mode. With every floor procedurally generated, every run offers new challenges and tough decisions.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3581670?t=1756916723","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581670/c46cde6a01198eb8999d33d6c4cc008db99cda3b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1756916723","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581670/c0a7d807c93958ec47fe88cc4536b6ecde1435b6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756916723","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581670/c0a7d807c93958ec47fe88cc4536b6ecde1435b6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756916723","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fractured Rift is a <i><strong>turn-based</strong>, <strong>grid-based rogue lite</strong></i> where strategy and customization are key. When a mysterious rift to another world tears open, you gather a team of skilled warriors or mages and set out to explore its shifting depths.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Choose your team</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equip them with powerful gear, and enter the rift, an endless descent through <i><strong>procedurally generated floors</strong></i> filled with dangerous enemies, new biomes, and evolving challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along the way, <i><strong>recruit new units, unlock new skills</strong></i>, and shape each unit with unique talents and equipment to fit your tactical vision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581670/extras/87775c293f1e100147c0d3c6cae0b072.poster.avif?t=1756