ssets/steam/apps/3581670/extras/ef4ee708ba4f8da491b2ad033a3a8992.webm?t=1756916723\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581670/extras/ef4ee708ba4f8da491b2ad033a3a8992.mp4?t=1756916723\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Use It or Keep It</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But there\u2019s a twist: if your team is defeated, you can redeem unused items<strong> from your inventory</strong> to be used in future explorations. So you have to decide whether to\u00a0<strong><i>use your resources now or save them for future explorations?</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you prefer full control or a more automated approach, the game lets you manually command your team or let them act on their own in auto battle mode. With every floor procedurally generated, every run offers new challenges and tough decisions.</p>","developers":["Virtual Sword"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581670/c3025bc63c887128f39a8784eaf434c5a6b01233/header.jpg?t=1756916723","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 22.04 LTS or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.0\u202fGHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 512MB VRAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 12.0 or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3 / Apple M1<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2\u202f GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 512MB VRAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space